sequenceDiagram
  participant PC as Post-call worker
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant PG as Provider policy gate
  participant L as Approved extraction LLM
  participant RB as Rule-based extractor
  participant Z as Zod schema
  PC->>DB: Load turns, safety events, citations
  PC->>PG: Which provider may process this data class?
  alt Provider allowed
    PG-->>PC: Approved provider
    PC->>L: Transcript delimited as untrusted data
    L-->>PC: Structured extraction
    PC->>Z: Validate
    alt Valid
      Z-->>PC: Typed result
      PC->>PC: Check evidence turn IDs exist, tag provenance
      PC->>DB: Save summary with model and prompt version
    else Invalid
      Z-->>PC: Errors
      PC->>RB: Fall back
      RB-->>PC: Rule-based result, marked low confidence
      PC->>DB: Save with method rule_based
    end
  else No provider allowed
    PG-->>PC: Denied
    PC->>RB: Rule-based only
    RB-->>PC: Result
    PC->>DB: Save with method rule_based
  end
  Note over PC,DB: Safety flags come from recorded events, never from the LLM alone
